msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FC1D2D85_AF57_4F40_9F84_7C36761A027F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Deep within the dense woods, a mansion appeared before us like the world fading into view "
"after a dream."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Посреди лесной чащи нашим глазам престал особняк, словно мир, замерший пред взором после сна."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A799B4C7_858A_400E_BCC4_6CAF6CD70413
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a17c07f30572878c908e3a1b1a3f34ca57594e3a2e38143d3abd2c7872c49089
