#: scenario5:scenario5_0749D473_4A71_4A3F_B81D_3734D5D2ECE7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5aad6178434d5618fb6b2895378f99426e9a3be7c76bc0b1e468171749c6010
